Build-time dependencies that are not redistributed here
--------------------------------------------------------
- Vulkan headers from Debian trixie libvulkan-dev 1.4.309.0-1 (Vulkan-Headers,
  Apache-2.0).  The build reads the headers from the pinned cross sysroot; no
  Vulkan header is copied into this directory.
- glslangValidator or glslc (glslang / SPIRV-Tools, BSD-3-Clause and related
  notices) is invoked only by the build operator to compile the checked-in
  GLSL.  The compiler binary is not redistributed.
- The provider dlopens the guest's existing libvulkan.so.1 (Debian
  vulkan-loader) and does not link or redistribute it.
- The guest's libblas3 / liblapack3 and NumPy remain untouched.  The provider
  only interposes the listed LP64 float32 symbols at run time and delegates
  everything else to the loaded original objects.

Reused design inputs
--------------------
The Vulkan loader/queue/buffer/flush/vendor-selection pattern follows the
Apache-2.0 Floe Linux virtual-GPU matmul qualification prototype
(2026-11-10).
The shaders and the general layout/stride interface in this package are new;
no fixed-size proof shader is shipped as a general pipeline.
